# No god editor setup

Do not add or use editor menus / `[InitializeOnLoad]` scripts that create or rewrite **everything** (scenes, prefabs, catalogs, spawn lists, Addressables, build settings) in one shot.

```csharp
// BAD
[MenuItem("GameCore/Setup Architecture (Scenes, Prefabs, Build Settings)")]
public static void Setup() {
    EnsureShipAssets();
    CreateGameScene();
    UpdateBuildSettings();
}

[InitializeOnLoadMethod]
static void AutoSetupIfMissing() => Setup();
```

```csharp
// GOOD — change only the asset you need, by hand or a tiny focused editor helper
SerializedObject serialized = new SerializedObject(socket);
serialized.FindProperty("_acceptedType").enumValueIndex = (int)ShipModuleType.Radar;
serialized.ApplyModifiedPropertiesWithoutUndo();
```

Place prefabs in the scene and spawn list yourself. Do not resurrect `GameArchitectureSetup`.
